{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o028a","title":"吕蒙入三郡刘备至公安关羽进益阳","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o028a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"吕蒙入三郡刘备至公安关羽进益阳","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o028a-q"]},{"id":"chenghuang-a-bac36a3de1973dfbdfaa","label":"正文","text":"宁益兵对羽羽住不渡名关羽濑","evidence":["chenghuang-q-8e91a90b14374430c121"]},{"id":"liuliao-a-9d0d56813c1c1375219c","label":"正文","text":"吕蒙掩袭南三郡廖立脱身归先主","evidence":["liuliao-q-68bd4c7e13290de845c9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"lu-meng","role":"取郡","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o028a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"进军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o028a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"进军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o028a-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0051","role":"拒降","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o028a-q"]},{"person":"gan-ning","role":"时有三百兵、曰可复以五百人益吾吾往对之保羽闻吾咳唾不敢涉水涉水即是吾擒、乃夜往","evidence":["chenghuang-q-8e91a90b14374430c121"]},{"person":"lu-su","role":"镇益阳、与诸将议、便选千兵益宁","evidence":["chenghuang-q-8e91a90b14374430c121"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"遣吕蒙掩袭南三郡","evidence":["liuliao-q-68bd4c7e13290de845c9"]},{"person":"liuliao-p0004","role":"脱身归先主","evidence":["liuliao-q-68bd4c7e13290de845c9"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":215,"label":"荆州争议时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y215","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o026","basis":"荆州争议时"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o028a-q","wuzhu-q-o026","wuzhu-q-b-6c673130b822b151c942"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o028a-q","source_order":[47,127,"O028a"],"order":8186}],"persons":[{"id":"gan-ning","name":"甘宁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liuliao-p0004","name":"廖立","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"lu-meng","name":"吕蒙","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"lu-su","name":"鲁肃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0051","name":"郝普","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-8e91a90b14374430c121","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-0727a48d0bc130478c74","layer":"original","quote":"后随鲁肃镇益阳，拒关羽。羽号有三万人，自择选锐士五千人，投县上流十余里浅濑〖1〗，云“欲夜涉渡”。肃与诸将议。宁时有三百兵，乃曰：“可复以五百人益吾，吾往对之。保羽闻吾咳唾〖2〗，不敢涉水；涉水，即是吾擒！”肃便选千兵益宁，宁乃夜往。羽闻之，住不渡，而结柴营〖3〗。今遂名此处为“关羽濑","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":143},{"id":"liuliao-q-68bd4c7e13290de845c9","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-08d2f565f2bb694ab4e3","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十年，权遣吕蒙掩袭南三郡〖3〗；立脱身走，自归先主。","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":156,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o028a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-aed5aacc47d73bf1a3f2","layer":"original","quote":"蒙到，二郡皆服，惟零陵太守郝普未下〖8〗。会备到公安〖9〗，使关羽将三万兵至益阳；权乃召蒙等，使还助肃。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52},{"id":"wuzhu-q-b-6c673130b822b151c942","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6c673130b822b151c942","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗益州：州名。治所在今四川成都市。此段所述史事发生在建安二十年（公元 215），参见本书卷三十二《先主传》。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":130,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1574d392980d4ec4daef","start":0,"end":56},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o026","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-80743944340fd37ea837","layer":"original","quote":"权以备已得益州〖1〗，令诸葛瑾从求荆州诸郡。备不许，曰：“吾方图凉州；凉州定，乃尽以荆州与吴耳。”权曰：“此假而不返〖2〗，而欲以虚辞引岁〖3〗！”遂置南三郡长吏〖4〗。关羽尽逐之〖5〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":124,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
